# src/ must ship so setuptools can install `groot` (layout is
# `[tool.setuptools.packages.find] where = ["src"]`). gear fast_launch
# materializes the symlinked src/groot/{core,vla,...} trees via
# os.walk(followlinks=True), so the zip grows by ~30MB but every
# `uv pip install -e .` on the pool succeeds.
# src/*
# Exclude external deps except gear_cli
external_dependencies/openhomie/*
external_dependencies/rl_locomotion/*
external_dependencies/g1_deploy/**
external_dependencies/sim2mujoco/*
external_dependencies/mfm/**
external_dependencies/mfm/*
external_dependencies/isaacgym_python310/*
external_dependencies/ws_lidar_slam_ros2/*
external_dependencies/Sharpa/*
# label-studio's deploy tree contains symlink farms and webapp assets that
# slow the os.walk and bloat the zip; never needed on training pools.
external_dependencies/label-studio/**
# Local git worktrees (created via `git worktree add wt/<name>`) duplicate the
# whole repo and would otherwise be walked + zipped.
wt/**
